#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j4-0-one-family-one-phone.json:5
msgctxt "description"
msgid "A year on, the family plans a trip to Taifafeki. Bounmy’s phone holds records for all three of them, including Somsak’s six verified doses."
msgstr "一年后，这家人计划去泰法费基旅行。Bounmy 的手机保存着他们三人的记录，其中包括 Somsak 的六剂已验证剂次。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j4-0-one-family-one-phone.json:242
